</div></section><section class="mt-24 xl:mx-8 lg:mx-2 xxs:mx-2 sm:mx-0 text-center"><h1 class="text-sar-blue-300 text-2xl font-normal">Our services</h1><h1 class="mt-3 text-dark text-4xl font-normal">SAR delivers a wide range of passenger and freight services across various regions of Saudi Arabia</h1><div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-4 xl:mx-80 xl:gap-1 lg:gap-1 xxs:gap-0  md:text-base sm:text-base xxs:text-xs"><button>Passenger trains</button><button>Car Cargo</button><button>Parcel shipments</button><button>Freight shipping</button></div><div><div class="w-full text-start "><div data-gatsby-image-wrapper="" class="gatsby-image-wrapper gatsby-image-wrapper-constrained rounded-lg max-h-96 sm:h-96 xxs:h-60 "><div style="max-width:6909px;display:block"><img alt="" role="presentation" aria-hidden="true" src="data:image/svg+xml;charset=utf-8,%3Csvg%20height=&#x27;4605&#x27;%20width=&#x27;6909&#x27;%20xmlns=&#x27;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#x27;%20version=&#x27;1.1&#x27;%3E%3C/svg%3E" style="max-width:100%;display:block;position:static"/></div><div aria-hidden="true" data-placeholder-image="" style="opacity:1;transition:opacity 500ms linear;background-color:#a89888;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0"></div><picture><source type="image/webp" data-srcset="/static/fbb71c138f219b94f0ab0e0550208fad/624da/sar-services.webp 1727w,/static/fbb71c138f219b94f0ab0e0550208fad/c151a/sar-services.webp 3455w,/static/fbb71c138f219b94f0ab0e0550208fad/1bc12/sar-services.webp 6909w" sizes="(min-width: 6909px) 6909px, 100vw"/><img data-gatsby-image-ssr="" data-main-image="" style="opacity:0" sizes="(min-width: 6909px) 6909px, 100vw" decoding="async" loading="lazy" data-src="/static/fbb71c138f219b94f0ab0e0550208fad/c58eb/sar-services.jpg" data-srcset="/static/fbb71c138f219b94f0ab0e0550208fad/ca822/sar-services.jpg 1727w,/static/fbb71c138f219b94f0ab0e0550208fad/63e05/sar-services.jpg 3455w,/static/fbb71c138f219b94f0ab0e0550208fad/c58eb/sar-services.jpg 6909w" alt=""/></picture><noscript><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="/static/fbb71c138f219b94f0ab0e0550208fad/624da/sar-services.webp 1727w,/static/fbb71c138f219b94f0ab0e0550208fad/c151a/sar-services.webp 3455w,/static/fbb71c138f219b94f0ab0e0550208fad/1bc12/sar-services.webp 6909w" sizes="(min-width: 6909px) 6909px, 100vw"/><img data-gatsby-image-ssr="" data-main-image="" style="opacity:0" sizes="(min-width: 6909px) 6909px, 100vw" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/static/fbb71c138f219b94f0ab0e0550208fad/c58eb/sar-services.jpg" srcSet="/static/fbb71c138f219b94f0ab0e0550208fad/ca822/sar-services.jpg 1727w,/static/fbb71c138f219b94f0ab0e0550208fad/63e05/sar-services.jpg 3455w,/static/fbb71c138f219b94f0ab0e0550208fad/c58eb/sar-services.jpg 6909w" alt=""/></picture></noscript><script type="module">const t="undefined"!=typeof HTMLImageElement&&"loading"in HTMLImageElement.prototype;if(t){const t=document.querySelectorAll("img[data-main-image]");for(let e of t){e.dataset.src&&(e.setAttribute("src",e.dataset.src),e.removeAttribute("data-src")),e.dataset.srcset&&(e.setAttribute("srcset",e.dataset.srcset),e.removeAttribute("data-srcset"));const t=e.parentNode.querySelectorAll("source[data-srcset]");for(let e of t)e.setAttribute("srcset",e.dataset.srcset),e.removeAttribute("data-srcset");e.complete&&(e.style.opacity=1,e.parentNode.parentNode.querySelector("[data-placeholder-image]").style.opacity=0)}}</script></div><div class="bg-white xl:w-1/3 lg:w-2/4 md:w-2/4 sm:w-3/4 xxs:w-2/3  absolute xl:-mt-80 lg:-mt-72 md:-mt-56 sm:-mt-72 xxs:-mt-52 md:ms-9 xxs:ms-2 md:p-3 xxs:p-1 rounded-md left-10 "><h1 class="md:text-2xl font-medium xxs:text-lg ms-3 mt-5 rtl:text-right">Passenger trains</h1><p class="md:text-base xxs:text-xs mx-3 mb-5 md:leading-6 rtl:text-right">SAR operates passenger trains on the North Line between Riyadh and Qurayyat, the East Line between Riyadh and Dammam, and the Haramain High-Speed Railway between Makkah and Madinah. SAR also operates the Mashair Train in Makkah.</p></div></div></div><div><div class="w-full text-start"><div data-gatsby-image-wrapper="" class="gatsby-image-wrapper gatsby-image-wrapper-constrained rounded-lg max-h-96 sm:h-96 xxs:h-60"><div style="max-width:3840px;display:block"><img alt="" role="presentation" aria-hidden="true" src="data:image/svg+xml;charset=utf-8,%3Csvg%20height=&#x27;2160&#x27;%20width=&#x27;3840&#x27;%20xmlns=&#x27;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#x27;%20version=&#x27;1.1&#x27;%3E%3C/svg%3E" style="max-width:100%;display:block;position:static"/></div><div aria-hidden="true" data-placeholder-image="" style="opacity:1;transition:opacity 500ms linear;background-color:#080808;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0"></div><picture><source type="image/webp" data-srcset="/static/6d5c86efb16ab26436ae9fcea79bc4b0/f63b3/CarShipping.webp 960w,/static/6d5c86efb16ab26436ae9fcea79bc4b0/89314/CarShipping.webp 1920w,/static/6d5c86efb16ab26436ae9fcea79bc4b0/b7766/CarShipping.webp 3840w" sizes="(min-width: 3840px) 3840px, 100vw"/><img data-gatsby-image-ssr="" data-main-image="" style="opacity:0" sizes="(min-width: 3840px) 3840px, 100vw" decoding="async" loading="lazy" data-src="/static/6d5c86efb16ab26436ae9fcea79bc4b0/0da3c/CarShipping.jpg" data-srcset="/static/6d5c86efb16ab26436ae9fcea79bc4b0/ad124/CarShipping.jpg 960w,/static/6d5c86efb16ab26436ae9fcea79bc4b0/9d72c/CarShipping.jpg 1920w,/static/6d5c86efb16ab26436ae9fcea79bc4b0/0da3c/CarShipping.jpg 3840w" alt=""/></picture><noscript><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="/static/6d5c86efb16ab26436ae9fcea79bc4b0/f63b3/CarShipping.webp 960w,/static/6d5c86efb16ab26436ae9fcea79bc4b0/89314/CarShipping.webp 1920w,/static/6d5c86efb16ab26436ae9fcea79bc4b0/b7766/CarShipping.webp 3840w" sizes="(min-width: 3840px) 3840px, 100vw"/><img data-gatsby-image-ssr="" data-main-image="" style="opacity:0" sizes="(min-width: 3840px) 3840px, 100vw" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/static/6d5c86efb16ab26436ae9fcea79bc4b0/0da3c/CarShipping.jpg" srcSet="/static/6d5c86efb16ab26436ae9fcea79bc4b0/ad124/CarShipping.jpg 960w,/static/6d5c86efb16ab26436ae9fcea79bc4b0/9d72c/CarShipping.jpg 1920w,/static/6d5c86efb16ab26436ae9fcea79bc4b0/0da3c/CarShipping.jpg 3840w" alt=""/></picture></noscript><script type="module">const t="undefined"!=typeof HTMLImageElement&&"loading"in HTMLImageElement.prototype;if(t){const t=document.querySelectorAll("img[data-main-image]");for(let e of t){e.dataset.src&&(e.setAttribute("src",e.dataset.src),e.removeAttribute("data-src")),e.dataset.srcset&&(e.setAttribute("srcset",e.dataset.srcset),e.removeAttribute("data-srcset"));const t=e.parentNode.querySelectorAll("source[data-srcset]");for(let e of t)e.setAttribute("srcset",e.dataset.srcset),e.removeAttribute("data-srcset");e.complete&&(e.style.opacity=1,e.parentNode.parentNode.querySelector("[data-placeholder-image]").style.opacity=0)}}</script></div><div class="bg-white xl:w-1/3 lg:w-2/4 md:w-2/4 sm:w-3/4 xxs:w-2/3  absolute xl:-mt-80 lg:-mt-72 md:-mt-56 sm:-mt-72 xxs:-mt-52 md:ms-9 xxs:ms-2 md:p-3 xxs:p-1 rounded-md left-10"><h1 class="md:text-2xl font-medium xxs:text-lg ms-3 mt-5  rtl:text-right">Car Cargo</h1><p class="md:text-base xxs:text-xs mx-3 mb-5 md:leading-6  rtl:text-right">You can ship your vehicle by train on the SAR North Line between Riyadh and Qurayyat, or vice versa. Choose to transport your car only, or ship it and travel on the same train.</p></div></div></div><div><div class="w-full text-start"><div data-gatsby-image-wrapper="" class="gatsby-image-wrapper gatsby-image-wrapper-constrained rounded-lg sm:h-96 max-h-96 xxs:h-60"><div style="max-width:7660px;display:block"><img alt="" role="presentation" aria-hidden="true" src="data:image/svg+xml;charset=utf-8,%3Csvg%20height=&#x27;5109&#x27;%20width=&#x27;7660&#x27;%20xmlns=&#x27;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#x27;%20version=&#x27;1.1&#x27;%3E%3C/svg%3E" style="max-width:100%;display:block;position:static"/></div><div aria-hidden="true" data-placeholder-image="" style="opacity:1;transition:opacity 500ms linear;background-color:#a89878;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0"></div><picture><source type="image/webp" data-srcset="/static/4cc06b4eaeabeb9c8272a853e36e062f/3d6be/ParcelShipping.webp 1915w,/static/4cc06b4eaeabeb9c8272a853e36e062f/9c52e/ParcelShipping.webp 3830w,/static/4cc06b4eaeabeb9c8272a853e36e062f/c5b96/ParcelShipping.webp 7660w" sizes="(min-width: 7660px) 7660px, 100vw"/><img data-gatsby-image-ssr="" data-main-image="" style="opacity:0" sizes="(min-width: 7660px) 7660px, 100vw" decoding="async" loading="lazy" data-src="/static/4cc06b4eaeabeb9c8272a853e36e062f/f0f08/ParcelShipping.jpg" data-srcset="/static/4cc06b4eaeabeb9c8272a853e36e062f/c3d73/ParcelShipping.jpg 1915w,/static/4cc06b4eaeabeb9c8272a853e36e062f/6ab88/ParcelShipping.jpg 3830w,/static/4cc06b4eaeabeb9c8272a853e36e062f/f0f08/ParcelShipping.jpg 7660w" alt=""/></picture><noscript><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="/static/4cc06b4eaeabeb9c8272a853e36e062f/3d6be/ParcelShipping.webp 1915w,/static/4cc06b4eaeabeb9c8272a853e36e062f/9c52e/ParcelShipping.webp 3830w,/static/4cc06b4eaeabeb9c8272a853e36e062f/c5b96/ParcelShipping.webp 7660w" sizes="(min-width: 7660px) 7660px, 100vw"/><img data-gatsby-image-ssr="" data-main-image="" style="opacity:0" sizes="(min-width: 7660px) 7660px, 100vw" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/static/4cc06b4eaeabeb9c8272a853e36e062f/f0f08/ParcelShipping.jpg" srcSet="/static/4cc06b4eaeabeb9c8272a853e36e062f/c3d73/ParcelShipping.jpg 1915w,/static/4cc06b4eaeabeb9c8272a853e36e062f/6ab88/ParcelShipping.jpg 3830w,/static/4cc06b4eaeabeb9c8272a853e36e062f/f0f08/ParcelShipping.jpg 7660w" alt=""/></picture></noscript><script type="module">const t="undefined"!=typeof HTMLImageElement&&"loading"in HTMLImageElement.prototype;if(t){const t=document.querySelectorAll("img[data-main-image]");for(let e of t){e.dataset.src&&(e.setAttribute("src",e.dataset.src),e.removeAttribute("data-src")),e.dataset.srcset&&(e.setAttribute("srcset",e.dataset.srcset),e.removeAttribute("data-srcset"));const t=e.parentNode.querySelectorAll("source[data-srcset]");for(let e of t)e.setAttribute("srcset",e.dataset.srcset),e.removeAttribute("data-srcset");e.complete&&(e.style.opacity=1,e.parentNode.parentNode.querySelector("[data-placeholder-image]").style.opacity=0)}}</script></div><div class="bg-white xl:w-1/3 lg:w-2/4 md:w-2/4 sm:w-3/4 xxs:w-2/3  absolute xl:-mt-80 lg:-mt-72 md:-mt-56 sm:-mt-72 xxs:-mt-52 md:ms-9 xxs:ms-2 md:p-3 xxs:p-1 rounded-md left-10"><h1 class="md:text-2xl font-medium xxs:text-lg ms-3 mt-5  rtl:text-right">Parcel shipments</h1><p class="md:text-base xxs:text-xs mx-3 mb-5 md:leading-6  rtl:text-right">SAR provides fast and secure parcel shipment services on the North and East Lines at competitive rates. You can ship parcels of various sizes (up to 60kg) between all North and East Line stations, with same-day delivery options available. </p></div></div></div><div><div class="w-full text-start"><div data-gatsby-image-wrapper="" class="gatsby-image-wrapper gatsby-image-wrapper-constrained rounded-lg sm:h-96 max-h-96 xxs:h-60"><div style="max-width:1440px;display:block"><img alt="" role="presentation" aria-hidden="true" src="data:image/svg+xml;charset=utf-8,%3Csvg%20height=&#x27;500&#x27;%20width=&#x27;1440&#x27;%20xmlns=&#x27;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#x27;%20version=&#x27;1.1&#x27;%3E%3C/svg%3E" style="max-width:100%;display:block;position:static"/></div><div aria-hidden="true" data-placeholder-image="" style="opacity:1;transition:opacity 500ms linear;background-color:#084858;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0"></div><picture><source type="image/webp" data-srcset="/static/d141c89aba89b625b7dfe4692a2d6f94/54784/freight.webp 360w,/static/d141c89aba89b625b7dfe4692a2d6f94/50434/freight.webp 720w,/static/d141c89aba89b625b7dfe4692a2d6f94/2c26a/freight.webp 1440w" sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 1440px, 100vw"/><img data-gatsby-image-ssr="" data-main-image="" style="opacity:0" sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 1440px, 100vw" decoding="async" loading="lazy" data-src="/static/d141c89aba89b625b7dfe4692a2d6f94/bf453/freight.png" data-srcset="/static/d141c89aba89b625b7dfe4692a2d6f94/f4c1e/freight.png 360w,/static/d141c89aba89b625b7dfe4692a2d6f94/cc891/freight.png 720w,/static/d141c89aba89b625b7dfe4692a2d6f94/bf453/freight.png 1440w" alt=""/></picture><noscript><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="/static/d141c89aba89b625b7dfe4692a2d6f94/54784/freight.webp 360w,/static/d141c89aba89b625b7dfe4692a2d6f94/50434/freight.webp 720w,/static/d141c89aba89b625b7dfe4692a2d6f94/2c26a/freight.webp 1440w" sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 1440px, 100vw"/><img data-gatsby-image-ssr="" data-main-image="" style="opacity:0" sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 1440px, 100vw" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/static/d141c89aba89b625b7dfe4692a2d6f94/bf453/freight.png" srcSet="/static/d141c89aba89b625b7dfe4692a2d6f94/f4c1e/freight.png 360w,/static/d141c89aba89b625b7dfe4692a2d6f94/cc891/freight.png 720w,/static/d141c89aba89b625b7dfe4692a2d6f94/bf453/freight.png 1440w" alt=""/></picture></noscript><script type="module">const t="undefined"!=typeof HTMLImageElement&&"loading"in HTMLImageElement.prototype;if(t){const t=document.querySelectorAll("img[data-main-image]");for(let e of t){e.dataset.src&&(e.setAttribute("src",e.dataset.src),e.removeAttribute("data-src")),e.dataset.srcset&&(e.setAttribute("srcset",e.dataset.srcset),e.removeAttribute("data-srcset"));const t=e.parentNode.querySelectorAll("source[data-srcset]");for(let e of t)e.setAttribute("srcset",e.dataset.srcset),e.removeAttribute("data-srcset");e.complete&&(e.style.opacity=1,e.parentNode.parentNode.querySelector("[data-placeholder-image]").style.opacity=0)}}</script></div><div class="bg-white xl:w-1/3 lg:w-2/4 md:w-2/4 sm:w-3/4 xxs:w-2/3  absolute xl:-mt-80 lg:-mt-72 md:-mt-56 sm:-mt-72 xxs:-mt-52 md:ms-9 xxs:ms-2 md:p-3 xxs:p-1 rounded-md left-10"><h1 class="md:text-2xl font-medium xxs:text-lg ms-3 mt-5  rtl:text-right">Freight shipping</h1><p class="md:text-base xxs:text-xs mx-3 mb-5 md:leading-6  rtl:text-right">&quot;SAR&quot; has vast experience in providing its customers with comprehensive transportation services, including freight transport, heavy transport of minerals, petroleum, petrochemicals, and container transport, through an integrated and safe network that works according to the best international standards.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="mt-24 xl:mx-8 lg:mx-2 xxs:mx-2 sm:mx-0 text-center"><h1 class="text-sar-blue-300 text-2xl font-medium">Travelling with SAR North &amp; East</h1><h1 class="mt-3 text-dark text-4xl font-medium">Start planning your next trip</h1><div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-3 xl:mx-80 xl:gap-1 lg:gap-1 xxs:gap-0  md:text-base sm:text-base xxs:text-xs"><button><span>Tickets</span></button><button><span>Travel Information</span></button><button><span>Travel Extras</span></button></div><hr class="relative mb-10 mt-[10px]"/><div><div class="flex w-full overflow-scroll scroll-smooth focus:scroll-auto no-scrollbar"><a class="flex-none w-[32rem] me-4 ltr:text-left rtl:text-right " href="/northern-train/ticketcategories/"><div data-gatsby-image-wrapper="" class="gatsby-image-wrapper gatsby-image-wrapper-constrained"><div style="max-width:7705px;display:block"><img alt="" role="presentation" aria-hidden="true" src="data:image/svg+xml;charset=utf-8,%3Csvg%20height=&#x27;5140&#x27;%20width=&#x27;7705&#x27;%20xmlns=&#x27;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#x27;%20version=&#x27;1.1&#x27;%3E%3C/svg%3E" style="max-width:100%;display:block;position:static"/></div><div aria-hidden="true" data-placeholder-image="" style="opacity:1;transition:opacity 500ms linear;background-color:#180818;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0"></div><picture><source type="image/webp" data-srcset="/static/c460ff477b708235e71acfe8790d3c27/e8a7e/ticket_types.webp 1926w,/static/c460ff477b708235e71acfe8790d3c27/759c9/ticket_types.webp 3853w,/static/c460ff477b708235e71acfe8790d3c27/b3a6b/ticket_types.webp 7705w" sizes="(min-width: 7705px) 7705px, 100vw"/><img data-gatsby-image-ssr="" data-main-image="" style="opacity:0" sizes="(min-width: 7705px) 7705px, 100vw" decoding="async" loading="lazy" data-src="/static/c460ff477b708235e71acfe8790d3c27/582e5/ticket_types.jpg" data-srcset="/static/c460ff477b708235e71acfe8790d3c27/dd67e/ticket_types.jpg 1926w,/static/c460ff477b708235e71acfe8790d3c27/780ed/ticket_types.jpg 3853w,/static/c460ff477b708235e71acfe8790d3c27/582e5/ticket_types.jpg 7705w" alt=""/></picture><noscript><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="/static/c460ff477b708235e71acfe8790d3c27/e8a7e/ticket_types.webp 1926w,/static/c460ff477b708235e71acfe8790d3c27/759c9/ticket_types.webp 3853w,/static/c460ff477b708235e71acfe8790d3c27/b3a6b/ticket_types.webp 7705w" sizes="(min-width: 7705px) 7705px, 100vw"/><img data-gatsby-image-ssr="" data-main-image="" style="opacity:0" sizes="(min-width: 7705px) 7705px, 100vw" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/static/c460ff477b708235e71acfe8790d3c27/582e5/ticket_types.jpg" srcSet="/static/c460ff477b708235e71acfe8790d3c27/dd67e/ticket_types.jpg 1926w,/static/c460ff477b708235e71acfe8790d3c27/780ed/ticket_types.jpg 3853w,/static/c460ff477b708235e71acfe8790d3c27/582e5/ticket_types.jpg 7705w" alt=""/></picture></noscript><script type="module">const t="undefined"!=typeof HTMLImageElement&&"loading"in HTMLImageElement.prototype;if(t){const t=document.querySelectorAll("img[data-main-image]");for(let e of t){e.dataset.src&&(e.setAttribute("src",e.dataset.src),e.removeAttribute("data-src")),e.dataset.srcset&&(e.setAttribute("srcset",e.dataset.srcset),e.removeAttribute("data-srcset"));const t=e.parentNode.querySelectorAll("source[data-srcset]");for(let e of t)e.setAttribute("srcset",e.dataset.srcset),e.removeAttribute("data-srcset");e.complete&&(e.style.opacity=1,e.parentNode.parentNode.querySelector("[data-placeholder-image]").style.opacity=0)}}</script></div><h1 class="text-blue text-3xl font-medium mt-10  max-sm:ms-5 mb-2  rtl:ms-7">Ticket types</h1><p class="me-3 max-sm:w-4/6	  max-sm:mx-3  rtl:ms-7 mx-auto overflow-visible">SAR offers a range of ticket types to suit your individual travel needs. Handpick the ticket that is right for you, and add extras such as baggage, meals or lounge access to personalize your experience with SAR.</p></a><a class="flex-none w-[32rem] me-4 ltr:text-left rtl:text-right" href="/northern-train/travelclasses/"><div data-gatsby-image-wrapper="" class="gatsby-image-wrapper gatsby-image-wrapper-constrained"><div style="max-width:6909px;display:block"><img alt="" role="presentation" aria-hidden="true" src="data:image/svg+xml;charset=utf-8,%3Csvg%20height=&#x27;4605&#x27;%20width=&#x27;6909&#x27;%20xmlns=&#x27;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#x27;%20version=&#x27;1.1&#x27;%3E%3C/svg%3E" style="max-width:100%;display:block;position:static"/></div><div aria-hidden="true" data-placeholder-image="" style="opacity:1;transition:opacity 500ms linear;background-color:#a89888;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0"></div><picture><source type="image/webp" data-srcset="/static/fbb71c138f219b94f0ab0e0550208fad/624da/travel_classess.webp 1727w,/static/fbb71c138f219b94f0ab0e0550208fad/c151a/travel_classess.webp 3455w,/static/fbb71c138f219b94f0ab0e0550208fad/1bc12/travel_classess.webp 6909w" sizes="(min-width: 6909px) 6909px, 100vw"/><img data-gatsby-image-ssr="" data-main-image="" style="opacity:0" sizes="(min-width: 6909px) 6909px, 100vw" decoding="async" loading="lazy" data-src="/static/fbb71c138f219b94f0ab0e0550208fad/c58eb/travel_classess.jpg" data-srcset="/static/fbb71c138f219b94f0ab0e0550208fad/ca822/travel_classess.jpg 1727w,/static/fbb71c138f219b94f0ab0e0550208fad/63e05/travel_classess.jpg 3455w,/static/fbb71c138f219b94f0ab0e0550208fad/c58eb/travel_classess.jpg 6909w" alt=""/></picture><noscript><picture><source type="image/webp" srcSet="/static/fbb71c138f219b94f0ab0e0550208fad/624da/travel_classess.webp 1727w,/static/fbb71c138f219b94f0ab0e0550208fad/c151a/travel_classess.webp 3455w,/static/fbb71c138f219b94f0ab0e0550208fad/1bc12/travel_classess.webp 6909w" sizes="(min-width: 6909px) 6909px, 100vw"/><img data-gatsby-image-ssr="" data-main-image="" style="opacity:0" sizes="(min-width: 6909px) 6909px, 100vw" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/static/fbb71c138f219b94f0ab0e0550208fad/c58eb/travel_classess.jpg" srcSet="/static/fbb71c138f219b94f0ab0e0550208fad/ca822/travel_classess.jpg 1727w,/static/fbb71c138f219b94f0ab0e0550208fad/63e05/travel_classess.jpg 3455w,/static/fbb71c138f219b94f0ab0e0550208fad/c58eb/travel_classess.jpg 6909w" alt=""/></picture></noscript><script type="module">const t="undefined"!=typeof HTMLImageElement&&"loading"in HTMLImageElement.prototype;if(t){const t=document.querySelectorAll("img[data-main-image]");for(let e of t){e.dataset.src&&(e.setAttribute("src",e.dataset.src),e.removeAttribute("data-src")),e.dataset.srcset&&(e.setAttribute("srcset",e.dataset.srcset),e.removeAttribute("data-srcset"));const t=e.parentNode.querySelectorAll("source[data-srcset]");for(let e of t)e.setAttribute("srcset",e.dataset.srcset),e.removeAttribute("data-srcset");e.complete&&(e.style.opacity=1,e.parentNode.parentNode.querySelector("[data-placeholder-image]").style.opacity=0)}}</script></div><h1 class="text-blue text-3xl font-medium mt-10  max-sm:ms-5 mb-2  rtl:ms-7">Travel Classes</h1><p class="me-3 max-sm:w-4/6  max-sm:mx-5  rtl:ms-7">From Economy Class value, to Business Class elegance, to the privacy and comfort of our Private Sleeper Cabins, SAR ensures you will always find the travel class that is right for you.</p></a><a class="flex-none w-[32rem] me-4 ltr:text-left rtl:text-right" href="/northern-train/buyingtickets/"><div data-gatsby-image-wrapper="" class="gatsby-image-wrapper gatsby-image-wrapper-constrained"><div style="max-width:7952px;display:block"><img alt="" role="presentation" aria-hidden="true" src="data:image/svg+xml;charset=utf-8,%3Csvg%20height=&#x27;5304&#x27;%20width=&#x27;7952&#x27;%20xmlns=&#x27;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#x27;%